{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/774884-solar-xp-how-much-are-you-getting","id":774884,"title":"Solar XP, how much are you getting?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-11-26T10:04:34-08:00","id":774884,"title":"Solar XP, how much are you getting?","content":"I have not yet been able to start properly planning a game, let alone get my groups schedule sorted out to play it (heck, I still have a ton of material I want to translate for them to read first). So, I'm curious about how easy is Solar XP to get in practice.<br /> <br /> Those of you who managed to get a game going, how is it working in terms of getting the SXP rewards? Has it been easy to get both rewards? Or is it more common to get only one of them? Is it common for a few player to get no SXP in a session?<br /> <br /> In short, I want any information you care to share about how much SXP people are getting in your games.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-26T10:08:31-08:00","id":774886,"title":"","content":"Our group does not like uneven progression, so we discuss solar XP after each game, declaring if the group should get 0, 2 or 4. More often than not, 2 is the consensus, but we've had 0s and one 4.<br /> <br /> As an exercise I've been calculating how much I should've been getting in the last 4 games I've played, and 2 was, again, what I would generally be getting anyway.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Glorious Useless-Post Prana<br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Cost: 2</span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">m; </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mins: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Linguistics 1, Essence 1 </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Type: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Simple</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Keywords: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mute</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Duration: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Instant</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Prerequisite Charms: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Ten-Characters Methodology</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2589-magnum-opus","name":"Magnum Opus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2589_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"821"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-26T11:26:19-08:00","id":774927,"title":"","content":"We usually all get an equal amount, based on how much the ST liked our roleplaying etc. Usually around 4 but we've got 5 or 3 occasionally, or even 2 for a very short session. Rarely, one person gets one extra for stuff like solving a puzzle (the player, not the character solved the puzzle).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Some of me humble homebrew for ex3:<br /> <span style=\"font-size:10px\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hOOjEGyoq3owLoUwIwTfWKTffzo_udsiUTwomw7wudA/edit#\" target=\"_blank\">Artifacts for Crumple's DB homebrew</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1tI2T1Re0G8QOuoXkH7Y4PrKQxk1BPEGpbi82SpkTyIw/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Some Lintha QCs</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1O2I_2iWTCflJ36ggkDvjTeXmzFsGHKRxAi6L_Ry6g4w/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">A Wyld Behemoth</a></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8838-tds","name":"TDS","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"275"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-26T11:32:31-08:00","id":774932,"title":"","content":"Onyl houserule I'm actually using for Exalted, everyone gets 4 Solar XP per session, as the different castes have different opportunities to get their XP and I foresaw problems that these conditions might cause. So everyone gets 4 and everyone is happy. Might regulate that down to three maybe in the future, or not, based on player feedback.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/47-lc1984","name":"LC1984","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar47_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-26T12:13:10-08:00","id":774953,"title":"","content":"I'm probably not giving my players <i>enough</i> Solar Experience, since we all are also in several forum games and feel that good roleplaying is its own reward. I might consider giving the group a steady reward based on how the roleplaying goes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-26T12:28:35-08:00","id":774963,"title":"","content":"I'm doing it RAW, just to see how progression works.<br /> <br /> Most of the time though unless your character is a shutin you'll usually get 4. Hell even being a shutin grants 2.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Read my shit at my <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/271207-sandact6-homebrew-topic\" target=\"_blank\">homebrew</a> topic, 2.5e and 3e material!<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1263020-alchemicals-2-0-3e-conversion-charm-design-request\" target=\"_blank\">Play Alchemical's in 3e now</a>, you're welcome.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1183-sandact6","name":"Sandact6","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1183_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-26T12:55:28-08:00","id":774977,"title":"","content":"I've scrapped role bonuses after it caused problems for our group. The general consensus is that its really unfair for some people to just not be given a chance to get as much XP in a session because certain types of events didn't come up.<br /> <br /> I've been doing 2 solar XP per session for everyone so as not to create inequality, but I will likely offer a small bonus if anyone particularly wows me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1414-pyrosorc","name":"Pyrosorc","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"353"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-26T13:03:16-08:00","id":774983,"title":"","content":"If one player pops their role bonus, doesn't this usually mean the rest of the group get it too despite not meeting their role objectives since they have 'ceded' the spotlight to another player allowing them to perform their caste role?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(10chars)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2721-elkovash","name":"Elkovash","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2721_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"528"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-26T14:53:56-08:00","id":775049,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elkovash</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/774884-solar-xp-how-much-are-you-getting?p=774983#post774983\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If one player pops their role bonus, doesn't this usually mean the rest of the group get it too despite not meeting their role objectives since they have 'ceded' the spotlight to another player allowing them to perform their caste role?</div> </div> </div> </div>You only get that bonus if you <b>intentionally</b> cede the spotlight. If a tiger jumps out of a bush and the Dawn kills it then you didn't intentionally cede the spotlight to him, he just rolled the highest init and killed it first, for example.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Some of me humble homebrew for ex3:<br /> <span style=\"font-size:10px\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hOOjEGyoq3owLoUwIwTfWKTffzo_udsiUTwomw7wudA/edit#\" target=\"_blank\">Artifacts for Crumple's DB homebrew</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1tI2T1Re0G8QOuoXkH7Y4PrKQxk1BPEGpbi82SpkTyIw/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Some Lintha QCs</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1O2I_2iWTCflJ36ggkDvjTeXmzFsGHKRxAi6L_Ry6g4w/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">A Wyld Behemoth</a></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8838-tds","name":"TDS","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"275"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-26T15:01:25-08:00","id":775051,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TDS</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/774884-solar-xp-how-much-are-you-getting?p=775049#post775049\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You only get that bonus if you <b>intentionally</b> cede the spotlight. If a tiger jumps out of a bush and the Dawn kills it then you didn't intentionally cede the spotlight to him, he just rolled the highest init and killed it first, for example.</div> </div> </div> </div>But if you allowed the Dawn to fight your way through the city guard, instead of just grabbing the spotlight and convincing them that you are not the droids they are looking for, you get the role bonus , (usually the whole party except dawn gets it.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/7019410/Images/Ex3%20KS%20Badge.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/910-ncolic","name":"Ncolic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar910_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-26T15:27:30-08:00","id":775062,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ncolic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/774884-solar-xp-how-much-are-you-getting?p=775051#post775051\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> But if you allowed the Dawn to fight your way through the city guard, instead of just grabbing the spotlight and convincing them that you are not the droids they are looking for, you get the role bonus , (usually the whole party except dawn gets it.)</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Forget it. Nora, hit them with your hammer.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;OKAY!&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-26T16:32:47-08:00","id":775090,"title":"","content":"I don't give out Solar XP per the rules, I just sometimes give it as a story reward. <br /> <br /> But my friend runs a starting game and uses the Solar XP RAW, and he says the PCs vary, but on average get about 2.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-26T16:57:57-08:00","id":775098,"title":"","content":"My group has a houserule of &quot;If anyone gets Solar XP, we all get Solar XP.&quot;<br /> <br /> Then we felt that was advancing too quickly, so the role and expression bonuses dropped to 1 XP instead of 2.<br /> <br /> We frequently hit 4 or 5 Solar XP per session (the Twilight and Eclipse have a hard time hitting their XP goals because we tend to be a bit hack-n-slashy). We might decide this is too generous in the future, but since we're playing with a brand-new edition we're OK with accumulating new toys quickly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/K9a6Pmp.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/998-korhal_iv","name":"Korhal_IV","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar998_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"592"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-26T17:19:07-08:00","id":775106,"title":"","content":"I haven't started running as of yet (have other games to finish up first, and a player that vehemently opposes us starting to play before our physical copies of the book show up because he is genuinely <i>terrified </i>that we'll abandon all our other games in favor of playing more Exalted), but I expect that all my players will earn 4 solar XP every session because of how I interpret what the book says about gaining it.<br /> <br /> Of course, I'm also of the mind that I'll be assuming all 4 solar XP as being gained and only reducing it if clear opportunities to gain it come up and are ignored by the player so that if my group's sessions run a bit short for life reasons it doesn't end up feeling like a penalty.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Not so noble anymore.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1823-drake","name":"Drake","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1823_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"456"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-26T17:38:42-08:00","id":775117,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pyrosorc</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/774884-solar-xp-how-much-are-you-getting?p=774977#post774977\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've scrapped role bonuses after it caused problems for our group. The general consensus is that its really unfair for some people to just not be given a chance to get as much XP in a session because certain types of events didn't come up.</div> </div> </div> </div>Solar XP to me reads as a mechanical incentive for players to drive the story, rather than simply reacting to plot set in front of them by the ST. I think the solution is to encourage the players to drive the game towards events that would allow for them to get their role bonuses. <br /> <br /> It's the difference between an ST saying, &quot;does anyone want to try and sneak in to the enemy stronghold&quot; and a player affirmatively saying &quot;Ebon Orchid will infiltrate the castle to steal valuable information about the enemy troop movements.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Chicanery-No: If a player uses this Charm in an abusive or exploitative manner, the ST may punch him right in the goddamn face.&quot; --TheDementedOne<br /> <br /> &quot;Happiness is <i>very</i> brittle and short-lived in the Exalted community, because <i>ressentiment</i> is our cultural touchstone.&quot; --Gayo","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3420-zelbinnean","name":"Zelbinnean","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3420_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5884"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-26T18:29:46-08:00","id":775137,"title":"","content":"Personally, I'd like to know how the role bonuses are working out. Most importantly, do you find that they actually support your player's character designs?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-26T19:38:14-08:00","id":775178,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The MG</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/774884-solar-xp-how-much-are-you-getting?p=775137#post775137\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Personally, I'd like to know how the role bonuses are working out. Most importantly, do you find that they actually support your player's character designs?</div> </div> </div> </div>My Zenith is the only one with trouble hitting their Role Bonus. The character they've made is less a preacher and more a 'lead by example' so it doesn't really fit that well. I could contrive more instances to let it shine but she spends a lot of time letting others take the spotlight while she silently supports so I give her the role bonus for that and call it a day.<br /> <br /> I'm pretty sure a person can only get 1 role and 1 expression bonus per session (... or did my mind make that up?) so they players are pretty much even all the time","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(10chars)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2721-elkovash","name":"Elkovash","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2721_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"528"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-27T19:13:36-08:00","id":775741,"title":"","content":"My players have been having trouble with it; most of them haven't been getting any, and I think only once, massive twice, has a character walked away with the full 4-point bonus. This isn't me being a jerk about it, at least not by any deliberate action. I've been declaring that with group consensus.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-27T20:01:13-08:00","id":775753,"title":"","content":"The Twilight in my group has trouble hitting the Role bonus because the character's an investigative type and not a crafter or sorcerer; moreover, most of our opposition tends to be of the mortal / Exalt / undead variety, so there's less &quot;discover ancient secrets of the First Age&quot; and more, &quot;Cathak Iketa has made a secret pact with the evil Guild sorcerers to cripple the local government and divide its assets among them!&quot; I am lightly bothered by this, but not terribly.<br /> <br /> The Eclipse is an Eclipse purely because the player wants the anima power, because oathbinding folks to random statements is hilarious. Since the player stays out of most IC conversations otherwise, he's not hitting the Role bonus either. I am completely not bothered by this.<br /> <br /> Ironically, since the Eclipse is massively into sorcery and Lore, if the Eclipse and Twilight swapped castes they'd probably have a much easier time achieving milestones, since the Eclipse enjoys rolling big bags of dice to declare the existence of random gods and how they totally owe him one from back in the day.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/K9a6Pmp.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/998-korhal_iv","name":"Korhal_IV","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar998_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"592"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-27T21:51:00-08:00","id":775800,"title":"","content":"This is what we worried about the role bonus: that it'd force the PCs into acting like a very narrow definition of the caste. So less stereotypical caste members would get less XP.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-27T22:34:29-08:00","id":775811,"title":"","content":"I've given out 4 per player almost every session so far, and I think they earned them all. I've got no idea why the role bonus seems to be people's problem though, it's ten times easier to get than then expression bonus.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-27T23:06:15-08:00","id":775818,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korhal_IV</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/774884-solar-xp-how-much-are-you-getting?p=775753#post775753\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Twilight in my group has trouble hitting the Role bonus because the character's an investigative type and not a crafter or sorcerer; moreover, most of our opposition tends to be of the mortal / Exalt / undead variety, so there's less &quot;discover ancient secrets of the First Age&quot; and more, &quot;Cathak Iketa has made a secret pact with the evil Guild sorcerers to cripple the local government and divide its assets among them!&quot; I am lightly bothered by this, but not terribly.<br /> <br /> The Eclipse is an Eclipse purely because the player wants the anima power, because oathbinding folks to random statements is hilarious. Since the player stays out of most IC conversations otherwise, he's not hitting the Role bonus either. I am completely not bothered by this.<br /> <br /> Ironically, since the Eclipse is massively into sorcery and Lore, if the Eclipse and Twilight swapped castes they'd probably have a much easier time achieving milestones, since the Eclipse enjoys rolling big bags of dice to declare the existence of random gods and how they totally owe him one from back in the day.</div> </div> </div> </div>A twilight caste has their role triggered whenever they learn something significant, learn something that advances a major or defining intimacy, the secrets of a supernatural being, or through the solving of a significant problem through the application of your knowledge or through education. The only thing in the role that requires being a sorcerer is the last one on creating a lasting and meaningful work of mystical power. That might help you out on getting the role xp out of the twilight as I see no reason why an investigator can't learn important things or find some way to apply the things they've learned to solving problems. It doesn't need to be lost knowledge crap like the secret pact would be valid so long as that information would be considered significant to your group.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-27T23:31:05-08:00","id":775822,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/774884-solar-xp-how-much-are-you-getting?p=775818#post775818\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> the solving of a significant problem through the application of your knowledge or through education.</div> </div> </div> </div>This alone can proc all the time. Recognizing a first age trap for what it is, reading a book written in old realm, figuring out that powdery substance is firedust, figuring out that powdery substance is NOT firedust. All sorts of things.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-28T01:12:01-08:00","id":775856,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/774884-solar-xp-how-much-are-you-getting?p=775818#post775818\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> A twilight caste has their role triggered whenever they learn something significant, learn something that advances a major or defining intimacy, the secrets of a supernatural being, or through the solving of a significant problem through the application of your knowledge or through education. The only thing in the role that requires being a sorcerer is the last one on creating a lasting and meaningful work of mystical power. That might help you out on getting the role xp out of the twilight as I see no reason why an investigator can't learn important things or find some way to apply the things they've learned to solving problems. It doesn't need to be lost knowledge crap like the secret pact would be valid so long as that information would be considered significant to your group.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Also, I think some people are missing a significant point of role triggers for solar experience. The twilight shouldn't be the one that is having hard time getting role bonus, the rest of the circle should. (In the event that twilight having hard time hitting role triggers.)<br /> <br /> For example a distract gambit benefiting the dawn allways gives the one using the gambit. Or letting the twilight go through city records to find dirt on the mayor, before moving in to confront her gives xp to everyone except twilight. <br /> Then letting eclipse to broker a deal by using that information instead of the Night just threatening her to comply, gives everyone except eclipse the bonus experience. <br /> (Assuming everyone is assisting the said characters to grab spotlight of course)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/7019410/Images/Ex3%20KS%20Badge.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/910-ncolic","name":"Ncolic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar910_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-28T06:12:28-08:00","id":775938,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/774884-solar-xp-how-much-are-you-getting?p=775818#post775818\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> The only thing in the role that requires being a sorcerer is the last one on creating a lasting and meaningful work of mystical power.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd say crafting an Artifact or Manse would also qualify. Creating stuff with Wyld Shaping Technique and upgrades probably often does, too.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-28T12:49:56-08:00","id":776156,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/774884-solar-xp-how-much-are-you-getting?p=775800#post775800\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This is what we worried about the role bonus: that it'd force the PCs into acting like a very narrow definition of the caste. So less stereotypical caste members would get less XP.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, one of the two examples is someone who doesn\u2019t really want to play an Eclipse, they just want to make funny jokes with anima powers. It is not a problem if they don\u2019t hit their role bonuses, both because the rules should encourage you to build a reasonable character and because the player is in this to force as many NPCs as possible to eat their hats, and could not care less about XP totals.<br /> <br /> The other bit is that the \u2018intentionally cede the spotlight\u2019 bonus is one that the Twilight hits pretty often \u2013 lots of:<br /> <br /> Twilight: \u201cWell, I only wanted to ask you some questions over tea, but since you appear intent on settling this with fisticuffs \u2013 Jade Hammer, if you would?\u201d<br /> <br /> Dawn: *Incoherent bellow of rage, Thunderclap Rush Attack*<br /> <br /> Twilight: &quot;Ooh, look, the survivors are so much more talkative now! Who wants some chai?&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/774884-solar-xp-how-much-are-you-getting?p=775818#post775818\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> A twilight caste has their role triggered whenever they learn something significant, learn something that advances a major or defining intimacy, the secrets of a supernatural being, or through the solving of a significant problem through the application of your knowledge or through education. The only thing in the role that requires being a sorcerer is the last one on creating a lasting and meaningful work of mystical power. That might help you out on getting the role xp out of the twilight as I see no reason why an investigator can't learn important things or find some way to apply the things they've learned to solving problems. It doesn't need to be lost knowledge crap like the secret pact would be valid so long as that information would be considered significant to your group.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, you\u2019re right, I\u2019d overlooked the \u201clearn something that advances a Major or Defining Intimacy.\u201d Part of it is that the Twilight\u2019s Intimacies are all set up around the campaign\u2019s starting region, but the campaign has moved away. The Twilight has Intimacies toward two other Circle members (the Dawn and Eclipse), and followed them there to help them out, but the current arc is really focused on angsty backstories of the Zenith and Night so the Twilight doesn\u2019t have any specific Intimacies to trigger.<br /> I will bring up the Intimacy issue next session, see if we can\u2019t squeeze in a Major Intimacy to the Zenith and start hitting that role bonus more often.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/K9a6Pmp.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/998-korhal_iv","name":"Korhal_IV","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar998_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"592"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-28T14:10:11-08:00","id":776196,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TDS</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/774884-solar-xp-how-much-are-you-getting?p=775049#post775049\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You only get that bonus if you <b>intentionally</b> cede the spotlight. If a tiger jumps out of a bush and the Dawn kills it then you didn't intentionally cede the spotlight to him, he just rolled the highest init and killed it first, for example.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> All you have to do to hit a role bonus there is to note how your character didn't even need to move, since the stroke was delivered such that the blood spray avoided the Circle. Dawn looks cooler, bing, 2 Solar XP.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/84-holden","name":"Holden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar84_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"673"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-28T14:39:45-08:00","id":776215,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korhal_IV</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/774884-solar-xp-how-much-are-you-getting?p=776156#post776156\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah, you\u2019re right, I\u2019d overlooked the \u201clearn something that advances a Major or Defining Intimacy.\u201d Part of it is that the Twilight\u2019s Intimacies are all set up around the campaign\u2019s starting region, but the campaign has moved away. The Twilight has Intimacies toward two other Circle members (the Dawn and Eclipse), and followed them there to help them out, but the current arc is really focused on angsty backstories of the Zenith and Night so the Twilight doesn\u2019t have any specific Intimacies to trigger.<br /> I will bring up the Intimacy issue next session, see if we can\u2019t squeeze in a Major Intimacy to the Zenith and start hitting that role bonus more often.</div> </div> </div> </div>Check the principals the character has as well, you might be able pull it off depending on the principal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-30T06:58:38-08:00","id":777124,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/774884-solar-xp-how-much-are-you-getting?p=775800#post775800\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This is what we worried about the role bonus: that it'd force the PCs into acting like a very narrow definition of the caste. So less stereotypical caste members would get less XP.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is the exact problem I had when first reading about SXP. The rules point out that is if fine and even fun to play non-stereotypical caste roles but then penalized them for doing so.<br /> <br /> Initially I plan to play a Night Caste Pirate Captain and She Who Must Be Obeyed (my wife) a Dawn Caste Assassin Bodyguard. Both of us may have difficulty getting some of the SXP. We may decide to re-think our Caste choices.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>while (horse.state == dead)<br /> {<br /> beat();<br /> }","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/830-amdramnar","name":"Amdramnar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-30T07:57:05-08:00","id":777149,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amdramnar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/774884-solar-xp-how-much-are-you-getting?p=777124#post777124\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This is the exact problem I had when first reading about SXP. The rules point out that is if fine and even fun to play non-stereotypical caste roles but then penalized them for doing so.<br /> <br /> Initially I plan to play a Night Caste Pirate Captain and She Who Must Be Obeyed (my wife) a Dawn Caste Assassin Bodyguard. Both of us may have difficulty getting some of the SXP. We may decide to re-think our Caste choices.</div> </div> </div> </div>Again i feel like i should point it out again, since its a crucial part of the sxp system. Your Caste, or how you choose to play that caste has no effect on how difficult for you to get SXP. If there is any difficulty in getting role bonus of SXP, it is your circlemates that should have hard time, not you.<br /> <br /> You dont get role bonus SXP for playing according to your caste, you get it by allowing <b>others </b>to get the spotlight in their on caste roles.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/7019410/Images/Ex3%20KS%20Badge.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/910-ncolic","name":"Ncolic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar910_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-30T08:09:11-08:00","id":777152,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ncolic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/774884-solar-xp-how-much-are-you-getting?p=777149#post777149\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Again i feel like i should point it out again, since its a crucial part of the sxp system. Your Caste, or how you choose to play that caste has no effect on how difficult for you to get SXP. If there is any difficulty in getting role bonus of SXP, it is your circlemates that should have hard time, not you.<br /> <br /> You dont get role bonus SXP for playing according to your caste, you get it by allowing <b>others </b>to get the spotlight in their on caste roles.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Actually you get it for both. It's a bulleted list. Playing your caste type gets you SXP. Letting someone else play their caste type gets you AND them SXP.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-30T08:27:06-08:00","id":777159,"title":"","content":"Of course, you only get 2 XP maximum either way. You need to get an expression bonus for the other 2 XP.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;From now on, instead of saying 'half-assed', I will use 'muled'. 'This is a muled job, Chris', I will say to my friend Chris. 'You need to do better, or your ass is grass. And not, like, metaphorical grass. There are weeds growing in there as we speak.'<br /> <br /> &quot;'The DEA is after you, man' I will tell him, in all seriousness.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8891-khantalas","name":"Khantalas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8891_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"899"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-30T08:49:28-08:00","id":777170,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amdramnar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/774884-solar-xp-how-much-are-you-getting?p=777124#post777124\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Initially I plan to play a Night Caste Pirate Captain and She Who Must Be Obeyed (my wife) a Dawn Caste Assassin Bodyguard. Both of us may have difficulty getting some of the SXP. We may decide to re-think our Caste choices.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;She Who Must Be Obeyed&quot; is also a name the Lover Clad In Raiment of Tears goes by. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-30T08:57:36-08:00","id":777175,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Unsung Hero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/774884-solar-xp-how-much-are-you-getting?p=777152#post777152\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Actually you get it for both. It's a bulleted list. Playing your caste type gets you SXP. Letting someone else play their caste type gets you AND them SXP.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nope; that is wrong, here is the text;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ex3 p.177</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Role Bonus<br /> Characters can gain 2 points of solar experience by fulfilling one of the following criteria per session:<br /> <br /> Intentionally ceding the \u2018spotlight\u2019 of the scene\u2019s focus to another player\u2019s character in such a way that it makes that character shine in the role of their Caste, or directly supporting them in a cool and dramatic expression of their Caste\u2019s function.</div> </div> </div> </div>Text continues to explain what each Caste's function is. That's all. You get EXpression bonus for playing your own character and Role bonus by helping others to play their character.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/7019410/Images/Ex3%20KS%20Badge.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/910-ncolic","name":"Ncolic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar910_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-30T09:01:16-08:00","id":777177,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ncolic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/774884-solar-xp-how-much-are-you-getting?p=777175#post777175\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Text continues to explain what each Caste's function is. That's all. You get EXpression bonus for playing your own character and Role bonus by helping others to play their character.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, I won't tell you it's wrong to play it that way, but you'll note that it's the first bullet of a bulleted list, which means all items are individually valid. I won't lie that it being separated by a page adds to the confusion, but Ceding the Spotlight is equal on the list, not the singular subject of the list.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-30T09:19:13-08:00","id":777184,"title":"","content":"Interestingly, if ceding the spotlight was the <i>only </i>way of getting role bonus, then the text explaining the list wouldn't say &quot;one of the following&quot;, emphasizing the one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;From now on, instead of saying 'half-assed', I will use 'muled'. 'This is a muled job, Chris', I will say to my friend Chris. 'You need to do better, or your ass is grass. And not, like, metaphorical grass. There are weeds growing in there as we speak.'<br /> <br /> &quot;'The DEA is after you, man' I will tell him, in all seriousness.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8891-khantalas","name":"Khantalas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8891_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"899"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-30T10:22:57-08:00","id":777223,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Khantalas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/774884-solar-xp-how-much-are-you-getting?p=777184#post777184\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Interestingly, if ceding the spotlight was the <i>only </i>way of getting role bonus, then the text explaining the list wouldn't say &quot;one of the following&quot;, emphasizing the one.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah , as in you cant get more than 2 xp per session by ceding the spotlight to a dawn and zenith, you'll get awarded once.<br /> <br /> Rereading it again, i can see that i read it wrong, but i am going to continue to you it the way i described, since it promotes teamplay and allows everyone to share the spotlight equally.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/7019410/Images/Ex3%20KS%20Badge.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/910-ncolic","name":"Ncolic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar910_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-30T10:33:21-08:00","id":777228,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ncolic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/774884-solar-xp-how-much-are-you-getting?p=777175#post777175\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Nope; that is wrong, here is the text;<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Text continues to explain what each Caste's function is. That's all. You get EXpression bonus for playing your own character and Role bonus by helping others to play their character.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sorry, you're flat out wrong there. It opens with 'Characters can gain 2 points of solar experience by fulfilling one of the following criteria per session:'\u200b The bit you quoted is <i>one of </i>the bullet-pointed criteria that follows. The other entries, for each Caste, are the other bullet-pointed criteria that can be tagged for the Role bonus. They are not subsections of the part you quoted.<br /> <br /> It's pretty normal formatting and I am surprised it's causing any confusion.<br /> <br /> Edit: Sorry, I must have had this window open for a while since I didn't see post #37 before I posted this.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acrozatarim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-30T11:03:08-08:00","id":777243,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Intentionally ceding the \u2018spotlight\u2019 of the scene\u2019s focus to another player\u2019s character in such a way that it makes that character shine in the role of their Caste, or directly supporting them in a cool and dramatic expression of their Caste\u2019s function. </div> </div> </div>I still think this makes it less likely to get the circle SXP. If you are playing a non-stereotypical caste, the other circle members cannot help make &quot;that character shine in the role of their Caste&quot; or &quot;directly supporting them in a cool and dramatic expression of their Caste's function&quot;. So while I will be able to get SXP helping other shine in their role, my wife and I lower the chances of the rest of the Circle to get SXP since we do not have much opportunity to shine in our Caste roles.<br /> <br /> I will reread this part of the rules though, as I have said before I am fairly inexperienced with Exalted.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>while (horse.state == dead)<br /> {<br /> beat();<br /> }","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/830-amdramnar","name":"Amdramnar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-30T11:09:03-08:00","id":777244,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amdramnar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/774884-solar-xp-how-much-are-you-getting?p=777124#post777124\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Initially I plan to play a Night Caste Pirate Captain and She Who Must Be Obeyed (my wife) a Dawn Caste Assassin Bodyguard. Both of us may have difficulty getting some of the SXP. We may decide to re-think our Caste choices.</div> </div> </div> </div>There are some non-standard caste choices that make it hard to get role bonuses, but I don't see how an assassin bodyguard Dawn is one of them. Dawns get role bonuses for killing enemies and protecting friends. If your assassin bodyguard isn't doing either of those things then I'm not sure what they <i>are </i>doing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">My homebrew: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1244979-abyssals-a-shadow-falls\" target=\"_blank\">Abyssals,</a> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1065949-infernals-to-rule-in-hell-complete-edition\" target=\"_blank\">Infernals,</a> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/781489-ex3-dragon-kings-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">Dragon Kings,</a> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1058142-lanaya-s-martial-arts-homebrew-compendium\" target=\"_blank\">martial arts.</a></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3559-lanaya","name":"Lanaya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3559_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"960"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}